<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico drains 117 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico drains 117 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico placed one single repurchase agreement whereby it had sought to drain 117 million pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The repurchase agreements was placed as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT	TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    117 million     1 day     21.90 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
